ent: Generated intent from transcript\") {\n  1138→\t\tt.Errorf(\"expected generated intent, got:\\n%s\", output)\n  1139→\t}\n  1140→\t// Should display generated outcome\n  1141→\tif !strings.Contains(output, \"Outcome: Generated outcome from transcript\") {\n  1142→\t\tt.Errorf(\"expected generated outcome, got:\\n%s\", output)\n  1143→\t}\n  1144→\t// Should NOT show placeholder text\n  1145→\tif strings.Contains(output, \"(not generated)\") {\n  1146→\t\tt.Errorf(\"expected no placeholder text when generated summary is present, got:\\n%s\", output)\n  1147→\t}\n  1148→}\n  1149→\n  1150→func TestFormatBranchExplain_MetadataTakesPrecedenceOverGenerated(t *testing.T) {\n  1151→\t// Test that stored Metadata takes precedence over GeneratedSummary\n  1152→\tnow := time.Now()\n  1153→\tcheckpoints := []checkpointWithMeta{\n  1154→\t\t{\n  1155→\t\t\tPoint: strategy.RewindPoint{\n  1156→\t\t\t\tCheckpointID: \"abc123def456\",\n  1157→\t\t\t\tDate:         now,\n  1158→\t\t\t\tSessionID:    \"2026-01-19-session1\",\n  1159→\t\t\t},\n  1160→\t\t\tMetadata: &checkpoint.CommittedMetadata{\n  1161→\t\t\t\tIntent:  \"Stored intent\",\n  1162→\t\t\t\tOutcome: \"Stored outcome\",\n  1163→\t\t\t},\n  1164→\t\t\tGeneratedSummary: &Summary{\n  1165→\t\t\t\tIntent:  \"Generated intent - should not be used\",\n  1166→\t\t\t\tOutcome: \"Generated outcome - should not be used\",\n  1167→\t\t\t},\n  1168→\t\t},\n  1169→\t}\n  1170→\n  1171→\toutput := formatBranchExplain(\"feature/test\", checkpoints, false, false, false, 0, 1)\n  1172→\n  1173→\t// Should display stored intent, not generated\n  1174→\tif !strings.Contains(output, \"Intent: Stored intent\") {\n  1175→\t\tt.Errorf(\"expected stored intent, got:\\n%s\", output)\n  1176→\t}\n  1177→\tif strings.Contains(output, \"Generated intent\") {\n  1178→\t\tt.Errorf(\"should not show generated intent when stored exists, got:\\n%s\", output)\n  1179→\t}\n  1180→\t// Should display stored outcome, not generated\n  1181→\tif !string